/span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">, e-mail, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">연락처</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">병역사항</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">이 정확하지 않은 경우 성적열람이 불가능 하오니 반드시 사진 업로드 및 기재사항 입력 하시기 바랍니다.</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">성적에 이의가 있어 성적정정 신청을 요하는 경우</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fare